        "Content": "Detached three-bedroom bungalow.\nExcellent location close to Kells town centre.\nIn need of some updating, offering excellent potential to create your ideal home.\nMay qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to eligibility\nEntrance hallway, kitchen, dining room, sitting room, three bedrooms and bathroom.\nEasy access to M3/M50 for commuting to Dublin.\nGenerous rear garden is not overlooked, offering excellent privacy.\nAttached garage with direct access from the kitchen and rear garden.\nTarmac driveway with off-street parking."
